{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:08:54.557Z","id":"50e17838755f3b05150a313f","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260816092847.2522994-1-egbostina%40gmail.com/","channels":["lkml"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:20260816092847.2522994-1-egbostina@gmail.com","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260816092847.2522994-1-egbostina%40gmail.com/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:08:54.557Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:20260816092847.2522994-1-egbostina@gmail.com"},"subject":"Re: [PATCH v2] dt-bindings: mfd: Convert TI TWL6040 to DT schema","messages":{"031e1ccd-c4d6-4dfe-8920-fa7b0e5deb7a@gmail.com":{"id":"031e1ccd-c4d6-4dfe-8920-fa7b0e5deb7a@gmail.com","messageId":"031e1ccd-c4d6-4dfe-8920-fa7b0e5deb7a@gmail.com","references":["20260816092847.2522994-1-egbostina@gmail.com"],"missingAncestorIds":["20260816092847.2522994-1-egbostina@gmail.com"],"author":{"name":"Dhruva G","address":"goledhruva@gmail.com"},"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-16T16:00:24.000Z","iso":"2026-08-16T16:00:24.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"Re: [PATCH v2] dt-bindings: mfd: Convert TI TWL6040 to DT schema","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-kernel.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-kernel.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Hi Eduard,"},{"kind":"quote","attribution":"On 16-08-2026 14:58, Eduard Bostina wrote:","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"Convert the Texas Instruments TWL6040 audio codecs family bindings to DT"},{"depth":1,"text":"schema."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"During the conversion, the following updates were made:"},{"depth":1,"text":"- Changed 'twl6040,audpwron-gpio' to 'ti,audpwron-gpio', which was"},{"depth":1,"text":"  misnamed in the old txt binding."},{"depth":1,"text":"- Made 'gpio-controller', '#gpio-cells', and 'ti,audpwron-gpio' optional"},{"depth":1,"text":"  because modern platforms do not require them."},{"depth":1,"text":"- Renamed the vibra 'vddvibl_uV'/'vddvibr_uV' properties to"},{"depth":1,"text":"  'ti,vddvibl-uV'/'ti,vddvibr-uV', the names actually read by the"},{"depth":1,"text":"  twl6040-vibra driver."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Signed-off-by: Eduard Bostina <egbostina@gmail.com>"},{"depth":1,"text":"---"},{"depth":1,"text":"Changes in v2:"},{"depth":1,"text":"- Renamed the vibra 'vddvibl_uV'/'vddvibr_uV' properties to "},{"depth":1,"text":"  'ti,vddvibl-uV'/'ti,vddvibr-uV', the names actually read by the"},{"depth":1,"text":"  twl6040-vibra driver."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Link to v1: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260815083451.2147129-1-egbostina@gmail.com/"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":" .../devicetree/bindings/mfd/ti,twl6040.yaml   | 142 ++++++++++++++++++"},{"depth":1,"text":" .../devicetree/bindings/mfd/twl6040.txt       |  67 ---------"},{"depth":1,"text":" 2 files changed, 142 insertions(+), 67 deletions(-)"},{"depth":1,"text":" create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/ti,twl6040.yaml"},{"depth":1,"text":" delete mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/twl6040.txt"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/ti,twl6040.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/ti,twl6040.yaml"},{"depth":1,"text":"new file mode 100644"}],"lineCount":29,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"[..snip..]"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+  vddvibl-supply:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+    description: Regulator for the left vibra motor"},{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+  vddvibr-supply:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+    description: Regulator for the right vibra motor"},{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+  vibra:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+    type: object"},{"depth":1,"text":"+    additionalProperties: false"},{"depth":1,"text":"+    properties:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+      ti,vibldrv-res:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        description: Resistance parameter for left driver"},{"depth":1,"text":"+      ti,vibrdrv-res:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        description: Resistance parameter for right driver"},{"depth":1,"text":"+      ti,viblmotor-res:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        description: Resistance parameter for left motor"},{"depth":1,"text":"+      ti,vibrmotor-res:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        description: Resistance parameter for right motor"},{"depth":1,"text":"+      ti,vddvibl-uV:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        description: vddvibl default voltage if it needs to be changed"},{"depth":1,"text":"+      ti,vddvibr-uV:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        description: vddvibr default voltage if it needs to be changed"},{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+    required:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+      - ti,vibldrv-res"},{"depth":1,"text":"+      - ti,vibrdrv-res"},{"depth":1,"text":"+      - ti,viblmotor-res"},{"depth":1,"text":"+      - ti,vibrmotor-res"},{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+required:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+  - compatible"},{"depth":1,"text":"+  - reg"},{"depth":1,"text":"+  - interrupts"},{"depth":1,"text":"+  - \"#clock-cells\""},{"depth":1,"text":"+  - vio-supply"},{"depth":1,"text":"+  - v2v1-supply"}],"lineCount":43,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"I think the vibra supplies need to be conditionally required when the vibra child is present. \ntwl6040_has_vibra() uses the presence of this child to instantiate twl6040-vibra, whose probe\nthen unconditionally gets both vddvibl and vddvibr."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Would something like this make sense?"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"allOf:\n  - if:"},{"kind":"code","text":"      required:\n        - vibra\n    then:\n      required:\n        - vddvibl-supply\n        - vddvibr-supply"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"This would still allow TWL6040 users without vibra, while retaining the dependency for users which enable it."},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+additionalProperties: false"},{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+examples:"},{"depth":1,"text":"+  - |"},{"depth":1,"text":"+    #include <dt-bindings/interrupt-controller/irq.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+    i2c {"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        #address-cells = <1>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        #size-cells = <0>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        audio-codec@4b {"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            compatible = \"ti,twl6040\";"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            reg = <0x4b>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            interrupts = <0 119 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            interrupt-parent = <&gic>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            gpio-controller;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            #gpio-cells = <1>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            #clock-cells = <0>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            ti,audpwron-gpio = <&gpio4 31 0>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            vio-supply = <&v1v8>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            v2v1-supply = <&v2v1>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            enable-active-high;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            /* regulators for vibra motor */"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            vddvibl-supply = <&vbat>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            vddvibr-supply = <&vbat>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            vibra {"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                ti,vibldrv-res = <8>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                ti,vibrdrv-res = <3>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                ti,viblmotor-res = <10>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+                ti,vibrmotor-res = <10>;"},{"depth":1,"text":"+            };"},{"depth":1,"text":"+        };"},{"depth":1,"text":"+    };"},{"depth":1,"text":"diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/twl6040.txt b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/twl6040.txt"},{"depth":1,"text":"deleted file mode 100644"}],"lineCount":39,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"[..snip..]"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260816092847.2522994-1-egbostina@gmail.com"}},"rootIds":["031e1ccd-c4d6-4dfe-8920-fa7b0e5deb7a@gmail.com"],"childrenByParent":{},"chronologicalIds":["031e1ccd-c4d6-4dfe-8920-fa7b0e5deb7a@gmail.com"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{}}}